# oblique sun patch and warm wood grain clipped inside tabletop\ntablemask=Image.new('L',im.size);ImageDraw.Draw(tablemask).ellipse((-189*S,666*S,757*S,850*S), fill=255)\ntable=im.copy();old=im;im=table;d=ImageDraw.Draw(im)\npoly([(-120,760),(279,665),(488,665),(-60,821)],'#e9b87d')\npoly([(215,853),(632,667),(751,669),(366,853)],'#edbd83')\nfor j in range(178):\n x=random.uniform(-100,758);y=random.uniform(660,854);l=random.uniform(9,100)\n curve(f'M{x} {y} Q{x+l*.5} {y-1.7} {x+l} {y+.2}',None,random.choice(['#d49d68','#cd9765','#e7b87f']),random.uniform(.45,1.1))\nold.paste(im,(0,0),tablemask);im=old;d=ImageDraw.Draw(im)\n# gingham linen draped over table edge, homography-like bilinear panels\ndef cloth(corners,nu,nv):\n a,b,c,e=corners\n def q(s,t):return tuple((1-t)*((1-s)*a[k]+s*b[k])+t*((1-s)*e[k]+s*c[k]) for k in (0,1))\n for j in range(nv):\n  for i in range(nu):\n   col=[['#f0d9b4','#d89f86'],['#d89f86','#bd7965']][i%2][j%2]\n   poly([q(i/nu,j/nv),q((i+1)/nu,j/nv),q((i+1)/nu,(j+1)/nv),q(i/nu,(j+1)/nv)],col)\ncloth([(393,718),(545,737),(322,852),(141,854)],16,18)\ncloth([(141,854),(322,852),(316,902),(146,906)],16,6)\n# soft cast shadows on table \noval(80,738,190,751,'#b88a5c');oval(259,752,466,781,'#bc8d60')\n# plate with a golden croissant\noval(254,733,459,777,'#a59776');oval(249,729,459,771,'#eee2bb');oval(263,734,445,765,'#9cafa0');oval(267,736,442,762,'#f5e8c7')\ncurve('M285 750 Q277 737 293 722 Q296 708 319 707 Q334 690 359 697 Q380 689 396 706 Q424 708 425 727 Q438 741 419 751 Q410 754 403 744 Q388 736 373 741 Q350 751 326 740 Q312 733 301 748 Q294 756 285 750','#a4673f')\nfor s,c in [\n('M284 745 Q281 729 297 718 Q311 716 312 729 Q301 731 294 746 Q289 751 284 745','#d4914d'),\n('M296 719 Q298 705 317 703 Q333 709 330 730 Q317 733 307 737 Q309 724 296 719','#e7a351'),\n('M317 705 Q331 692 350 697 Q366 707 358 738 Q346 744 330 736 Q331 717 317 705','#f1b360'),\n('M348 697 Q369 688 384 699 Q393 712 379 738 Q367 743 355 738 Q363 714 348 697','#e7a253')